### Enviar cola de check in/out de una unidad — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/sendCheckInOutQueue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "UNIT-001",
  "appVersion": "1.0.0",
  "queue": "[{\"working\":1,\"location\":{\"utcTime\":\"2026-01-15T20:30:00Z\",\"latitude\":14.634915,\"longitude\":-90.506882,\"speed\":0,\"heading\":0,\"odometer\":1000}}]"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/sendCheckInOutQueue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "UNIT-001",
  "appVersion": "1.0.0",
  "queue": "[{\"working\":1,\"location\":{\"utcTime\":\"2026-01-15T20:30:00Z\",\"latitude\":14.634915,\"longitude\":-90.506882}}]"
}

### Validación: sin unitIdentifier → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/sendCheckInOutQueue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appVersion": "1.0.0",
  "queue": "[{\"working\":1,\"location\":{\"utcTime\":\"2026-01-15T20:30:00Z\",\"latitude\":14.634915,\"longitude\":-90.506882}}]"
}

### Validación: sin queue → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/sendCheckInOutQueue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "UNIT-001",
  "appVersion": "1.0.0"
}

### Validación: queue no es un JSON válido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/sendCheckInOutQueue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "UNIT-001",
  "appVersion": "1.0.0",
  "queue": "esto no es json"
}

### Validación: queue es un arreglo vacío → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/sendCheckInOutQueue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "UNIT-001",
  "appVersion": "1.0.0",
  "queue": "[]"
}
